:"With the wedding looming, everyone begins to realize a strange turn in the couple's relationship.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/oEai4BtQPsBbxOJqQYe7wCaMtZx.jpg","released":"2026-05-01T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"75 min"},{"id":"tt39333617:1:8","season":1,"episode":8,"title":"Episodio 8","overview":"The 21st-century Grand Prince's wife arrives. Amid cheers and wary eyes, two men make a bold choice.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/t9uctG2yxaIFb95oZx7aUvYkiNp.jpg","released":"2026-05-02T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"66 min"},{"id":"tt39333617:1:9","season":1,"episode":9,"title":"Episodio 9","overview":"Facing a political crisis, the couple choose to fight to protect one another, each in their own way.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/pPC3EeQRvmrc3QyuU4HPzVaXx2R.jpg","released":"2026-05-08T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"65 min"},{"id":"tt39333617:1:10","season":1,"episode":10,"title":"Episodio 10","overview":"Others step in for the couple who struggle to be honest, and a new era begins to stir at the court.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/rPpwwriBd2IhhugTvlVKaYih4Dy.jpg","released":"2026-05-09T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"77 min"},{"id":"tt39333617:1:11","season":1,"episode":11,"title":"Episodio 11","overview":"Like that day, fire engulfs Council Hall. Huiju protects Grand Prince I-AN while fighting an enemy.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/icPWuj0bd0sRbkE9baJWiCu8UT4.jpg","released":"2026-05-15T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"65 min"},{"id":"tt39333617:1:12","season":1,"episode":12,"title":"Episodio 12","overview":"No barrier is unbreakable, only those who wish it so. Can they leap beyond and shape their destiny?","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/osYja5t4SgBaFSIFStXhZ6uXB1h.jpg","released":"2026-05-16T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"73 min"},{"id":"tt39333617:0:1","season":0,"episode":1,"title":"Preview","overview":"A special preview video featuring a drama introduction, highlight previews, and more,","released